OL,3,GNEWSABishop accused of bullying to
OL,4,Aretire next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's first female bishop has
OL,7,Fannounced she is to retire in 2027,
OL,8,Ffive years after being accused of
OL,9,Fbullying.
OL,11,FThe Right Reverend Anne Dyer, the
OL,12,FScottish Episcopal Church's Bishop of
OL,13,FAberdeen and Orkney, was suspended in
OL,14,F2022.
OL,16,FThe church's independent procurator
OL,17,Freviewed the evidence and decided it
OL,18,Fwas not in the public interest to
OL,19,Fpursue matters any further.
OL,21,FBishop Dyer will retire when she turns
OL,22,F70 in February.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
